# Goal

Block 206 tests whether the positive Block-205 eight-effect law descends to
the one-site `M2` possibility domain as a source-dependent binary law without
importing the four coarse ports as an external selector.  It then tests the
literal source/detector phase on the six nearest-neighbor displacements and
the proper-cubic orbit.  The campaign must distinguish a physical local
Admissibility context from a Fourier fixture or supplied apparatus setting.

## Frozen objects

Keep the Block-205 H1 `L=24` two-sector action, mass `2/7`, `12|12` cut,
ordinary-transpose right-Schur construction, literal forward/actual-reverse
source, and TT column index `1`.  Keep the Block-194 four coarse projectors
`E_st`, classified orientation `J`, eight joint effects, and nonidentity
pointer writer.  The frozen incoming momentum and transfer are

```text
incoming p = (pi/6, pi/3, 0)
q = (pi/3, pi/2, 0)
```

in the three spatial coordinates.

For the exact relative phase `phi=q.(x-x_src)`, define

```text
K_st(phi) = exp(-i phi) E_st J
F_(st,sigma)(phi) = 1/2 [[E_st, sigma K_st(phi)],
                         [sigma K_st(phi)^dagger, E_st]]
P_sigma(phi) = sum_st F_(st,sigma)(phi)
r_sigma(e,phi) = Tr(rho_R(e) P_sigma(phi)).
```

No effect fitting, source adjoint substitution, favorable port, favorable
phase, coherence ansatz, or replacement state is permitted.

## Stage A: port-free binary series

Rebuild the exact Schur inverse/graph recurrence and compute the cleared exact
rational numerator of `Delta(e)=r_+(e)-r_-(e)`.  Sector parity makes it odd;
the known zero linear coefficient is a control, not a conclusion.  Search from
order three until the first exact nonzero coefficient.  If no coefficient is
found in the bounded computation, prove `Delta(e)` identically zero by an
exact state/effect exchange symmetry; do not stop at a finite truncation.

- If an exact coefficient is nonzero, combine it with Block-205 strict
  positivity and analyticity to prove a finite positive nonconstant binary
  `M2` law without conditioning on `st`.
- An exact identity claim requires a symmetry that fixes the state family and
  exchanges `P_+` and `P_-`; a finite-order zero alone is only a scout and does
  not finish Stage A.

The four conditional laws `q_(sigma|st)` remain controls.  They may not be
substituted for the port-free result.

## Stage B: nearest-neighbor phase and cubic orbit

First inverse-Fourier reconstruct the literal H1 forward and actual-reverse
source on the commensurate `Z_12^3` spatial carrier.  The source vertex depends
on both `p` and `q`; a lookup from the transfer phase alone is forbidden.

Define `eta_x` as six actual neighboring `M2` Record contents.  Classify the
proper-cubic equivariant linear Hom spaces from (a) scalar/central contents on
the signed neighbor shell and (b) the explicitly conditional Pauli-adjoint
`M2` Bloch action to the frozen second-TT shear/source tensor.  The scalar
shell has no license to import the missing `T2` channel; the adjoint route must
name its internal/external action and decoder as conditional unless derived.
No 24-entry orbit lookup is admissible.

Then evaluate all six displacements `delta in {+/-e_1,+/-e_2,+/-e_3}` with
`x_src=x+delta`.  Test whether at least two conditions give different positive
binary laws on one finite germ.  Build the full 24-frame simultaneous orbit;
check translations, trace covariance, stabilizer descent, and every collision
where identical radius-one conditions would demand inequivalent sources or
probabilities.  Test H2 as the sealed non-cubic held-out after H1 passes.

This stage closes only if one fixed local map reconstructs the action source
without collisions.  A rotated Fourier label, supplied coframe, or free map
between two 24-element orbits is not `eta` closure.

## Stage C: exact context/axiom decision

If only the port-conditioned laws vary, identify the minimum physical object
that would select one `E_st` from `eta_x` and test whether the same equivariant
Hom class supplies it.  Do not stipulate a decoder and call that a derivation.

An axiom edit requires two complete same-input physical laws that satisfy the
same source, neighbor, event, formation, covariance, and readability criteria
yet disagree with no remaining discriminator.  A missing port selector or
source-to-neighbor map is downstream law content, not by itself an axiom flaw.

## Stop and accounting

Stop on carrier conflation, a tangent treated as a state, an unproved
all-order zero, a supplied port/coframe, absent required `T2` intertwiner,
global `p/q` metadata not reconstructible from `eta_x`, an H2/held-out failure,
loss of positivity, or a Fourier relabeling presented as a local rule.  Every bounded negative must execute
N1--N8 and preserve AP/open/periodic, alternative detector, complete-law,
formation/history, and independent gravity routes.

Formal obligation retirement and TOE percentage movement are precommitted to
zero unless a complete local `eta -> M2` probability law and its physical
Record context actually close.
